Package: hypermodR
Type: Package
Title: Hyperspectral Modelling and Validation
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Raban", "Heller", email = "raban.heller@charite.de",
    role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-8006-9742"))
Description: Interpretable and black-box hyperspectral modelling with explicit
    spectral, spatial and temporal data contracts, grouped validation,
    reproducible evaluation, optional isolated model runtimes, and an
    interactive research workbench. Model and instrument qualification is
    recorded separately from interface availability.
